<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine forex market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Philippine forex market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine foreign exchange market is closed on Wednesday as the nation honours Filipino World War Two soldiers.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the peso closed a shade lower at 26.369 to the dollar as against the previous day's close of 26.238.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
